  unitName: Light Bulb
  unitId: 850034
  unitNumber: 8029
  description: Once a budding plant growing on the highest peaks of mountains above
    the clouds, they embrace the purest of daylight, in time harnessing the essence
    of light within them. They illuminate with a soft bright glow. Adventurers often
    capture Light Bulbs as a light source to traverse in the night, and or exploring
    the underworld of caverns and mountains. Some lady folks seek them to be consumed
    as rumors say that it helps with the fair glow of the skin.
  summonDesc: '*Ziiinng bop bop*'
